          "guid": "mszea7lexlwcvvzi",
          "message": {
            "text": "Non-affine 3D contexts are snapshotted once at the outer context root and clipped to the capture viewport. The generated oracle proves projective perspective activates the snapshot while affine scale3d remains vector-native, and the preserve-3d visual fixture matches Chromium with zero differing pixels.",
            "markdown": "Non-affine 3D contexts are snapshotted once at the outer context root and clipped to the capture viewport. The generated oracle proves projective perspective activates the snapshot while affine scale3d remains vector-native, and the preserve-3d visual fixture matches Chromium with zero differing pixels."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/script/index.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 142,
                  "endLine": 159,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    // SVG cannot encode a projective fourth corner or preserve-3d flattening.\n    // Snapshot the outermost 3D context once; descendants remain in the tree\n    // for metadata/paint ordering but the renderer returns after this image.\n    if (_nonAffineProjectiveRoots.has(el)) {\n      let _left = rect.left, _top = rect.top, _right = rect.right, _bottom = rect.bottom;\n      const _subs = el.getElementsByTagName('*');\n      for (let _ri = 0; _ri < _subs.length; _ri++) {\n        const _rr = _subs[_ri].getBoundingClientRect();\n        if (_rr.width <= 0 || _rr.height <= 0) continue;\n        _left = Math.min(_left, _rr.left); _top = Math.min(_top, _rr.top);\n        _right = Math.max(_right, _rr.right); _bottom = Math.max(_bottom, _rr.bottom);\n      }\n      const _rx = Math.max(vp.x, _left), _ry = Math.max(vp.y, _top);\n      const _rright = Math.min(vp.x + vp.width, _right), _rbottom = Math.min(vp.y + vp.height, _bottom);\n      if (_rright > _rx && _rbottom > _ry) {\n        transformSubtreeRaster = { x: _rx - vp.x, y: _ry - vp.y, width: _rright - _rx, height: _rbottom - _ry };\n      }\n    }"
